{
    "title": "SmartHQ",
    "description": "Effortlessly control and monitor your smart appliances from GE Appliances, Profile, Caf\u00e9, Monogram, Fisher & Paykel, and Haier \u2013 all in one app.  \r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\n\u2022 REMOTE CONTROL \u2013 Monitor and control your appliances from anywhere, ensuring peace of mind and convenience.  \r\n\u2022 VOICE INTEGRATION \u2013 Use your voice to manage your appliances with Amazon Alexa and Google Assistant.\r\n\u2022 STAY INFORMED - Receive timely notifications about your appliances, including alerts and updates.\r\n\u2022 SOFTWARE UPDATES - Keep your appliances running smoothly with the latest software updates and access new features as they become available.  \r\n\u2022 PERSONALIZED EXPERIENCE - Create shortcuts for frequently used functions and download new modes for your appliances.  \r\n\u2022 MONITOR ENERGY & WATER USAGE - Gain insights into your appliance's energy and water consumption, helping you make informed choices.  \r\n\u2022 ENHANCED COOKING EXPERIENCE - Generate cooking recipes using Flavorly AI. Monitor your oven's progress with the built-in camera and pair accessories such as smart cookware and probes. \r\n\u2022 CONVENIENT PRODUCT REGISTRATION - Register all your GE appliances, even non-Wi-Fi models, for quick access to manuals, specs, and support.  \r\n\u2022 GET EXPERT HELP - Access the SmartHQ Assistant for answers to your appliance questions.\r\n\u2022 PROACTIVE SERVICE - Receive service alerts when your appliance needs attention and use the diagnostics tool to troubleshoot issues.\r\n\u2022 SCHEDULE SERVICE - Schedule a technician visit or access appliance support contact information.  \r\n\r\n*Note: Features may vary depending on your appliance model and country of residence.\r\n\r\nREMOTE CONTROL REQUIREMENTS:  \r\nRequires a compatible SmartHQ-enabled appliance or SmartHQ Connect module. SmartHQ Connect modules can be purchased online: https://www.geapplianceparts.com/store/parts/spec/PBX23W00Y0?SpecType=SpecType \r\n\r\nOPTIONAL APP PERMISSIONS: \r\n\u2022 Location, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth/BLE \r\n   - Used for commissioning nearby appliances.  \r\n\u2022 Notifications \r\n   - Used for product updates and status notifications. \r\n\u2022 Camera/Media Files  \r\n   - Used for Flavorly Picture to Recipe feature.  \r\n   - To scan QR codes to add appliances. \r\n   - To scan product barcodes and provide recipes.  \r\n\u2022 Precise Location  \r\n   - Used for enabling Automation feature (i.e. Home/Away mode). \r\n\r\nDownload SmartHQ today and unlock a world of connected convenience in your home!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Effortlessly control and monitor your smart appliances from GE Appliances, Profile, Caf\u00e9, Monogram, Fisher &amp; Paykel, and Haier \u2013 all in one app.  <br><br>KEY FEATURES:<br>\u2022 REMOTE CONTROL \u2013 Monitor and control your appliances from anywhere, ensuring peace of mind and convenience.  <br>\u2022 VOICE INTEGRATION \u2013 Use your voice to manage your appliances with Amazon Alexa and Google Assistant.<br>\u2022 STAY INFORMED - Receive timely notifications about your appliances, including alerts and updates.<br>\u2022 SOFTWARE UPDATES - Keep your appliances running smoothly with the latest software updates and access new features as they become available.  <br>\u2022 PERSONALIZED EXPERIENCE - Create shortcuts for frequently used functions and download new modes for your appliances.  <br>\u2022 MONITOR ENERGY &amp; WATER USAGE - Gain insights into your appliance&#39;s energy and water consumption, helping you make informed choices.  <br>\u2022 ENHANCED COOKING EXPERIENCE - Generate cooking recipes using Flavorly AI. Monitor your oven&#39;s progress with the built-in camera and pair accessories such as smart cookware and probes. <br>\u2022 CONVENIENT PRODUCT REGISTRATION - Register all your GE appliances, even non-Wi-Fi models, for quick access to manuals, specs, and support.  <br>\u2022 GET EXPERT HELP - Access the SmartHQ Assistant for answers to your appliance questions.<br>\u2022 PROACTIVE SERVICE - Receive service alerts when your appliance needs attention and use the diagnostics tool to troubleshoot issues.<br>\u2022 SCHEDULE SERVICE - Schedule a technician visit or access appliance support contact information.  <br><br>*Note: Features may vary depending on your appliance model and country of residence.<br><br>REMOTE CONTROL REQUIREMENTS:  <br>Requires a compatible SmartHQ-enabled appliance or SmartHQ Connect module. SmartHQ Connect modules can be purchased online: https://www.geapplianceparts.com/store/parts/spec/PBX23W00Y0?SpecType=SpecType <br><br>OPTIONAL APP PERMISSIONS: <br>\u2022 Location, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth/BLE <br>   - Used for commissioning nearby appliances.  <br>\u2022 Notifications <br>   - Used for product updates and status notifications. <br>\u2022 Camera/Media Files  <br>   - Used for Flavorly Picture to Recipe feature.  <br>   - To scan QR codes to add appliances. <br>   - To scan product barcodes and provide recipes.  <br>\u2022 Precise Location  <br>   - Used for enabling Automation feature (i.e. Home/Away mode). <br><br>Download SmartHQ today and unlock a world of connected convenience in your home!",
